00:17:46.280 --> 00:17:51.320
years that wouldn't clear no matter what

00:17:48.600 --> 00:17:53.400
I did, and I had this weight on my face

00:17:51.320 --> 00:17:55.920
that made me look so tired, even though

00:17:53.400 --> 00:17:58.000
I slept 9 hours. So, and I swear this is

00:17:55.920 --> 00:18:00.120
such a weird glow-up hack, when I really

00:17:58.000 --> 00:18:02.480
let it rip and cry everything out, the

00:18:00.120 --> 00:18:04.440
