00:18:09.600 --> 00:18:13.200
release our stress so that we don't hold

00:18:11.160 --> 00:18:15.200
on to this chronic stress, and worst of

00:18:13.200 --> 00:18:16.840
all, let it live in our bodies. Point

00:18:15.200 --> 00:18:18.560
